{"page":357,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:54","surah":24,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَطِيعُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُوا۟ ٱلرَّسُولَ ۖ فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَإِنَّمَا عَلَيْهِ مَا حُمِّلَ وَعَلَيْكُم مَّا حُمِّلْتُمْ ۖ وَإِن تُطِيعُوهُ تَهْتَدُوا۟ ۚ وَمَا عَلَى ٱلرَّسُولِ إِلَّا ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Obey God; obey the Messenger. If you turn away, [know that] he is responsible for the duty placed upon him, and you are responsible for the duty placed upon you. If you obey him, you will be rightly guided, but the Messenger’s duty is only to deliver the message clearly.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"Obey","transliteration":"aṭīʿū","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and obey","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūla","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"but if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","en_gloss":"you turn away","transliteration":"tawallaw","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"then only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"upon him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حُمِّلَ","en_gloss":"(is) placed on him","transliteration":"ḥummila","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَعَلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"and on you","transliteration":"waʿalaykum","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حُمِّلْتُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) placed on you","transliteration":"ḥummil'tum","verse_key":"24:54"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِن