ms, and obey the Messenger, so that you may be given mercy.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَقِيمُوا۟","en_gloss":"And establish","transliteration":"wa-aqīmū","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَءَاتُوا۟","en_gloss":"and give","transliteration":"waātū","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"zakah","transliteration":"l-zakata","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and obey","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūla","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُرْحَمُونَ","en_gloss":"receive mercy","transliteration":"tur'ḥamūna","verse_key":"24:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:56"}]},{"verse_key":"24:57","surah":24,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"لَا تَحْسَبَنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مُعْجِزِينَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ ٱلنَّارُ ۖ وَلَبِئْسَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not think [Prophet] that the disbelievers can escape God on earth; the Fire will be their final home, an evil end.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَحْسَبَنَّ","en_gloss":"think","transliteration":"taḥsabanna","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُعْجِزِينَ","en_gloss":"(can) escape","transliteration":"muʿ'jizīna","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"And their abode","transliteration":"wamawāhumu","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنَّارُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(will be) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāru","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَبِئْسَ","en_gloss":"and wretched is","transliteration":"walabi'sa","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_gloss":"the destination","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","verse_key":"24:57"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:57"}]},{"verse_key":"24:58","surah":24,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لِيَسْتَـْٔذِنكُمُ ٱلَّذِينَ مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُكُمْ وَٱلَّذِينَ لَمْ يَبْلُغُوا۟ ٱلْحُلُمَ مِنكُمْ ثَلَـٰثَ مَرَّٰتٍ ۚ مِّن قَبْلِ صَلَوٰةِ ٱلْفَجْرِ وَحِينَ تَضَعُونَ ثِيَابَكُم مِّنَ ٱلظَّهِيرَةِ وَمِنۢ بَعْدِ صَلَوٰةِ ٱلْعِشَآءِ ۚ ثَلَـٰثُ عَوْرَٰتٍ لَّكُمْ ۚ لَيْسَ عَلَيْكُمْ وَلَا عَلَيْهِمْ جُنَاحٌۢ بَعْدَهُنَّ ۚ طَوَّٰفُونَ عَلَيْكُم بَعْضُكُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يُبَيِّنُ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, your slaves and any who have not yet reached puberty should ask your permission to come in at three times of day: before the dawn prayer; when you lay your garments aside in the midday heat; and after the evening prayer. These are your three times for privacy; at other times, there is no blame on you or them if you move around each other freely. In this way God makes messages clear: God is all knowing, all wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"24:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"24:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِيَسْتَـْٔذِنكُمُ","en_gloss":"Let ask your permission","transliteration":"liyastadhinkumu","verse_key":"24:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom","transl